# 39 Bharat Nagar — Zero Required Environment Variables
# This application runs completely out-of-the-box with zero API keys, zero paid services,
# and zero required environment variables.
#
# Built-in defaults (automatically applied):
# - Server port: process.env.PORT || 3000
# - Local Wi-Fi signalling endpoint: same-origin /ws/signalling
# - WebRTC ICE servers: default public STUN servers with automatic WebSocket relay fallback
# - WebSocket origin check: automatic same-host verification
